#: ../../source/usage.rst:180 862c2eaef74e445783eb980f9ada1a39
msgid ""
"**Ask for the whole configuration, rather than assembling it.** "
":code:`foc.hfi_size()` -- :code:`foc_hfi_size()` from C -- takes the "
"machine and the control rate and returns the carrier, the amplitude, and "
"both cutoffs:"
msgstr ""
"**要一整套配置，而不是自己拼。** :code:`foc.hfi_size()` ——C 侧是 :code:`foc_hfi_size()` "
"——取机器与控制频率，返回载波、幅值以及两个截止频率："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:188 a11f3776d29b40f1830f31910ce440bd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The amplitude is the volts that draw the HF current *you* budget ($V = "
"I_{hf}\\,\\omega_h L_d$), so the injection becomes a decision about "
"current -- which is what sizes the torque ripple and the extra losses -- "
"instead of a voltage copied from an example. And the result is a "
"configuration the library accepts: that is what the tests assert, because"
" a sizing tool that recommends something the library then refuses would "
"be worse than no tool."
msgstr ""
"幅值是为 *你* 预算的高频电流所需的电压（$V = I_{hf}\\,\\omega_h "
"L_d$），于是注入变成一个关于电流的决定——而电流才决定转矩纹波与附加损耗——而不是从示例里照抄的一个电压。并且结果是一份库接受的配置：这正是测试所断言的，因为一个推荐的配置会被库拒绝的定量工具，比没有工具更糟。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:193 2bc8d04f1db0462192500f80de0a73a9
msgid ""
"**The demodulation window is a fixed choice, not a scheduled one.** "
"Across standstill to 50 rad/s mechanical it changes the angle error by "
"under 0.5 %, and at standstill the *narrowest* window is best by 14x. "
"What looked like \"a narrow window breaks at speed\" is a start-up "
"transient, which is what the blanking time is for."
msgstr ""
"**解调窗口是固定选择，不随转速调度。** 从静止到 50 rad/s 机械，它让角度误差的变化不到 0.5 %；而在静止时 *最窄* "
"的窗口最好，好 14x。看起来像“窄窗口在高速下会坏”的现象其实是一段起动暂态，消隐时间正是为它准备的。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:197 13d26bb287394901b8a80370ab160bbc
msgid ""
"**What is left at low speed is the injection's own price.** In a closed "
"servo at 20 rad/s the steady bias is 0.0039 rad/s — 0.02 % — and the "
"remainder is a ripple at the carrier frequency. It is not the estimator, "
"the angle, the window, the rotor's inertia or the demodulator's clamp: it"
" scales with the injected current (a third of the volts, 0.36 of the "
"tone) and with speed (4.0x the speed, 4.0x the tone), and it is "
"indifferent to the saliency. It is the injected current cross-coupling "
"into torque on a turning machine, and :code:`inject_v` is the knob that "
"sizes it."
msgstr ""
"**低速下剩下的东西，是注入自身的代价。** 在一个 20 rad/s 的闭环伺服里，稳态偏差是 0.0039 rad/s——0.02 "
"%——其余部分是载波频率上的纹波。它不是估计器、不是角度、不是窗口、不是转子惯量、也不是解调器的钳位：它随注入电流成比例（电压三分之一，单音 "
"0.36），也随转速成比例（转速 4.0x，单音 4.0x），并且对凸极率不敏感。它是注入电流在一台转动的机器上交叉耦合进转矩， "
":code:`inject_v` 就是给它定尺寸的旋钮。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:203 47f98db43794441b93337b032f587ee6
msgid ""
"**Watch it rather than assume it.** :code:`status()` carries the "
"observer's own verdict:"
msgstr "**看着它，别假设它。** :code:`status()` 携带观测器自己的判定："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:212 9b26125ef35f464a84bf3b28f5ad8f60
msgid ""
":code:`observer_error` is exactly zero for observers that publish no "
"error signal, so read it together with :code:`observer_locked` and "
":code:`observer`."
msgstr ""
"对不发布误差信号的观测器， :code:`observer_error` 恰好为零，因此要连同 :code:`observer_locked` 与"
" :code:`observer` 一起读。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:215 a28c20c25ec04215b42642f246db9d0b
msgid ""
"**Record the window, rather than watching a scalar.** A status report "
"answers \"what is true now\"; a fault is usually a question about the "
"last few milliseconds. The trace channel is a ninth policy on the motor, "
"so it is chosen at compile time and costs nothing when it is not chosen:"
msgstr ""
"**录下窗口，而不是盯着一个标量。** "
"状态报告回答“现在什么是真的”，而一次故障通常问的是最近几毫秒。轨迹通道是电机上的第九个策略，因此它在编译期选定，未选定时不付代价："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:231 accb3c59105d408d8aa30b9d81f12fda
msgid ""
"One sample per period, six numbers and two states: the measured currents "
"the PI acted on, the currents it was asked for, the voltage it applied, "
"the mechanical speed, and the mode and status the period ended in. With "
"the default :code:`foc::core::NullTrace` the type is empty -- no member, "
"no branch, no pointer check -- so \"off costs nothing\" is a property of "
"the type system rather than a promise about the optimiser."
msgstr ""
"每个周期一条采样，六个数与两个状态：PI 据以动作的实测电流、要求它给的电流、它施加的电压、机械转速，以及该周期结束时的模式与状态。默认的 "
":code:`foc::core::NullTrace` "
"让这个类型是空的——没有成员、没有分支、没有指针检查——所以“关掉不花钱”是类型系统的性质，而不是对优化器的承诺。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:236 acd0a0811bc7436fa7434bae9aa148d5
msgid ""
"A full ring keeps recording and counts what it overwrote, because "
"forgetting with a counter is reversible and stopping is not: a trace that"
" freezes when it fills loses exactly the window a fault is interesting "
"in. Timestamps come from the platform clock, truncated to 32 bits (71.6 "
"minutes); with no clock every :code:`t_us` is zero, which means \"no "
"timestamp\" rather than \"everything happened at once\"."
msgstr ""
"环满之后继续记录，并统计覆盖掉多少条，因为带计数的遗忘是可逆的，停住不是：填满即冻结的轨迹恰好丢掉故障最有意思的那段窗口。时间戳来自平台时钟，截断到"
" 32 位（71.6 分钟）；没有时钟时每个 :code:`t_us` 都是零，这表示“没有时间戳”，而不是“所有事同时发生”。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:241 de65eb0cdafa4813a436744afc30e139
msgid ""
"From C the same window is caller-owned storage and a run-time capacity, "
"because the ABI is one type for every caller:"
msgstr "从 C 看，同一个窗口是调用方拥有的存储加上运行期容量，因为 ABI 对所有调用方只有一种类型："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:253 0f29d6db1b64425293871b55e588c8c3
msgid ""
"and from Python the storage belongs to the object, so there is nothing to"
" keep alive by hand:"
msgstr "而从 Python 看，存储属于对象本身，没有需要手工保活的东西："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:263 ef937fac7f0942b19115752540e72137
msgid ""
"The C path pays one null check per period for that run-time capacity -- "
"predictable, and nothing when detached. The compiled-in C++ path pays "
"nothing because the capacity is the type. Measured cost of the whole "
"feature where it lands: the Debug archive grew 8.6 KB (56.9 to 65.6 KB), "
"of which the code is 1.5 KB and the ten new functions themselves about "
"0.65 KB; the rest is DWARF for two new types, which a Release artifact "
"does not carry. A Release ROM figure has **not** been measured, and is "
"not claimed."
msgstr ""
"C 路径为这个运行期容量每个周期付一次空指针检查——可预测，未挂接时不付。编译期写死的 C++ "
"路径一分不付，因为容量就是类型。整个特性落到实处的实测代价：Debug 归档增长 8.6 KB（从 56.9 KB 到 65.6 KB），其中代码"
" 1.5 KB、十个新函数本身约 0.65 KB；其余是两个新类型的 DWARF，Release 产物不携带。Release 的 ROM 数字 "
"**没有** 测过，也不作主张。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:269 5fb7529c20e4436ea3b20c7e218a131d
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Three things this channel is measured to do, and one it cannot. Measured:"
" a sample agrees with "
":code:`telemetry()`/:code:`state()`/:code:`status()` **bit for bit** in "
"the same period; the null channel adds no storage and no branch (host, "
"best of three rounds: 158.0 ns/period off against 161.9 on over 20 000 "
"periods -- the +3.9 ns difference is at the resolution of that "
"measurement, and one round of it reported recording as *faster*, which is"
" how a noise figure announces itself); and a sample survives a "
":code:`%.9g` text round trip bit for bit, so a trace written to a file is"
" still the same numbers when it is read back. What it cannot do is tell "
"you what the *hardware* did -- it records what the loop believed, so a "
"perfect-looking trace is entirely consistent with a miscalibrated current"
" sensor. Per-period cost on a target is also unmeasured here: the host "
"figure above says nothing about a 100 MHz core, and a budget for that is "
"a claim somebody would have to take with a scope."
msgstr ""
"这条通道被测出能做三件事，还有一件做不到。已测：同一周期内，一条采样与 :code:`telemetry()` /:code:`state()` "
"/:code:`status()` **逐位** 一致；空通道不增加存储、不增加分支（主机上三轮取最好：20 000 "
"个周期，关闭158.0ns/周期，开启 161.9——+3.9 ns 的差值在该测量的分辨率量级上，其中一轮甚至报告记录 *更快* "
"，一个噪声数字就是这样自报家门的）；一条采样经 :code:`%.9g` "
"文本往返后逐位不变，因此写进文件的轨迹读回来仍是同一组数。做不到的是告诉你 *硬件* "
"做了什么——它记录的是环所相信的东西，因此一条看起来完美的轨迹，与一个标定错误的电流传感器完全相容。目标板上的逐周期代价在这里同样没有测量：上面的主机数字对一个"
" 100 MHz 内核什么也没说，那笔预算得有人拿示波器去主张。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:277 fa7c142e451d4eb0969b3f0cf14be4bc
msgid ""
"**Compare a window instead of remembering a number.** A status report "
"answers \"what is true now\" and a trace answers \"what the loop did\"; "
"neither answers \"did this change\". Three recorded windows do, and they "
"are compared on demand:"
msgstr ""
"**比较窗口，而不是记住一个数。** "
"状态报告回答“现在什么是真的”，轨迹回答“环做了什么”；两者都不回答“这件事变了吗”。三段录下来的窗口回答得了，它们按需比较："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:285 50bbea3fe9b24d9aaa72e2755a23409f
msgid ""
"Each window is plain text: a header naming the scenario and the module "
"hash it came from, then one line per sample. It is readable in a diff, "
"which is the only reason a stored number can be reviewed instead of "
"trusted. The report names the **trace**, the **quantity** and the "
"**difference**, and classifies it:"
msgstr ""
"每个窗口都是纯文本：一段头信息写明场景和它来自的模块哈希，然后每条采样一行。它在 diff "
"里可读，这也是一个存下来的数能被审阅而不是被信任的唯一理由。报告写出 **哪条轨迹** 、 **哪个量** 、 **差多少** ，并给它分类："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:289 bd2d3a3013ec43d196be82c80912a8af
msgid "what a difference means"
msgstr "差异的含义"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:293 f93cfed29dba41678c4aa37ddb7b399a
